  "content": "<p>本專案已停止維護，請參閱&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/JustARandomGuyNo512/GCAA-gunscraft_1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">JustARandomGuyNo512/GCAA-gunscraft_1.20.1 (github.com)</a></p><p>新版模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guns-craft-adventurers-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guns Craft Adventurer's Arsenal - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></p><p>槍械工藝：</p><p>適用於Minecraft forge 1.20.1版本的槍械模組&nbsp;</p><p><del>#本模組目前處於開發階段</del></p><p>本模組傾向生存玩法：採集、合成、射擊。適合需要槍械支援的PVE情境。</p><p><br>#模組擁有精緻的槍械與配件模型，以及驚豔的模型渲染優化<br>#可為武器安裝各類配件，改變武器屬性...</p><h1><del>合成系統即將加入...</del></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p>請勿使用optifine...</p><p>自beta v0.3.5版本起已適配optifine...</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QpXTRjFpG4\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/fPHHpWZJHS</a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QpXTRjFpG4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/QpXTRjFpG4</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>現有槍械清單：Glock19、M1911、Mini-uzi、Mac10、Vector .45、Mp5、M4a1、Akm、Hk416、AK74、Aug-a3、Famas-F1、SCAR-H、Mini-m249、M60、Mg3、M700、M82A1 Awp、M870、Beretta 686、xm1014</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/876/720/2024-05-28_14.png\"></p><p>實戰截圖（真實效果）：</p><p>雙持手槍：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/807/257/2024-02-12_13.png\" alt=\"雙持手槍\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>槍燈輔助採礦：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/876/719/2024-05-28_14.png\"></p><p>酷炫配件系統：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/859/597/tactical_ak.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mg3（加裝紅點瞄具）：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/722/2024-01-10_16.png\" alt=\"mg3射擊\" width=\"1897\" height=\"1005\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>戰術版m4a1：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/807/258/2024-02-13_19.png\" alt=\"戰術m4a1\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p><p>游騎兵：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/807/259/2024-02-13_15.png\" alt=\"游騎兵\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>不同槍種有專屬運作機制：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/238/2024-02-22_10.png\" alt=\"awp栓動上膛\" width=\"1897\" height=\"1005\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;成為狙擊手！：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/789/236/sniper_rifle.png\" alt=\"狙擊體驗\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p><p>瞄準鏡射擊：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/137/2024-05-09_18.png\"></p><p>可自由改裝槍械配件：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/859/596/2024-05-04_22.png\"></p><p>配件會改變武器外觀與性能&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/809/118/2024-02-17_01.png\" alt=\"hk416改裝版\" width=\"1897\" height=\"1005\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/136/2024-05-09_18.png\"></p><p>（建議搭配oculus模組使用光影）...</p>",
